  "description": "Hong Kong in the 1990s. Tae-sSong, the perennial second-in-command of the Black Blue Gang, attempts a rebellion taking advantage of the boss's absence, but fails miserably. To Tae-Seong, who is begging for his life, the boss reveals a way to survive… \n\n“Betraying me, killing the executives, running off with company funds, everything… I will turn a blind eye if you win. Unless you beg at my touch.”\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)\n\n*Note: Part of Lezhin's Hole Sweet Hole Danpyeonseon (홀스윗홀 단편선) Collection.*",
